[31m-# FPGA-Based Traffic Light Controller with Priority System[m
[31m-[m
[31m-A four-way traffic light controller designed using **Verilog HDL, finite state machine (FSM) architecture, and FPGA implementation**. The project supports normal traffic sequencing and manual emergency vehicle priority, targeting the Digilent Basys 3 development board featuring the AMD/Xilinx Artix-7 FPGA.[m
