[31m-## FPGA Build and Programming[m
[31m-[m
[31m-To reproduce the FPGA build:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-1. Open the project in AMD/Xilinx Vivado.[m
[31m-2. Add the required Verilog source files.[m
[31m-3. Set `top_module` as the top module.[m
[31m-4. Add `FPGA/constraints/basys3.xdc`.[m
[31m-5. Run RTL elaboration and synthesis.[m
[31m-6. Run implementation and review timing and design-rule reports.[m
[31m-7. Generate the bitstream.[m
[31m-8. Program the Basys 3 and verify the normal traffic sequence and emergency priority behavior.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The committed bitstream should correspond to the committed RTL and XDC files.[m
